  "comparison_notes": [
    "Model/class fields are compatibility identity; do not replace real nabu geometry or managed RAM with stock iPad values.",
    "EnhancedMultitasking keys are candidates relevant to Stage Manager; their complete consumer policy was not established here.",
    "DeviceSupportsApplePencil reports an OS capability declaration, not proof of nabu pen protocol support.",
    "Memory bytes should be captured through hw.memsize and Android /proc/meminfo. DevicePerformanceMemoryClass exists as a literal but its obfuscated query identifier was not found; it is not included as a verified query.",
    "No MGSetAnswer, cache deletion, cache rebuild or write API is part of this scan. MG may maintain its own internal cache during normal queries."
  ],
